# S-044: frame-rate-divisor sub-outputs. create_with_frame_rate_divisor copies the output descriptor and multiplies
# fps_den by the divisor; divisor 0 or 1 or a NULL parent gives NULL. Registration, locking, counters, active and the
# format/size/frame-rate getters all act on the root; get_info and get_frame_time act on the copy itself.
vopen v I420 60 1 16 8 3
vdivider x v 0
vdivider x v 1
vdivider c v 2
vinfo c
vinfo v
# connections made on the child land on the root
vconnect c a 1
vinputs v
vstate c
vstate v
vlock c 1 10 0x0c
vunlock c
vstate v
vtex c frames
vstate c
vdump c
vdisconnect2 c a 1
vstate v
vstop c
vstate v
# freeing a root through the child-free call is a no-op
vfree_divider_root v
vfree_divider c
vclose v
